    "created_at": "2015-12-19T15:42:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-19T15:42:08Z",
    "body": "Could it be that browsers vary on synthetic vs non-synthetic event? Would be good to also test the scenario where the user agent dispatches the event before changing things.\n",
